 --> main.kg:8:46
  |
8 | fn cValue(v: &ffi.CValue[Int]) -> *mut Int { v.ptr() }
  |                                              ^^^^^^

error[E2316]: `cString` passed the recoverable-only profile, yet producing this `*const u8` result allocates a box that a refused allocation would end the program on; allocate inside an `allocator` block
